cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Edge-Optimized MA1DCNN for Real-Time Aerospace Fault Diagnosis"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Odawa"
    given-names: "Isse"
date-released: 2026-08-26
abstract: >
  An edge-optimized, attention-based 1D convolutional neural network
  (E-O MA1DCNN) for real-time aircraft engine fault classification on
  resource-constrained edge hardware (NVIDIA Jetson Nano), evaluated on
  the NASA N-CMAPSS turbofan degradation dataset.
